From e7e8b55c42c6592ce5adedbdbb0484c9f0722d16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MaR4eJl <marchel666@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 07:58:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: conversational agent mode; stronger agent engine; drop
 Arena
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Focus shifted to a real autonomous agent (arena.ai Agent Mode style), keeping
the role/model routing ("distribution"). Model comparison (Arena) removed.

Agent engine (core):
- ToolLoop now accumulates the full step history so the agent reasons over its
  whole progress (was: only the last tool result — broke multi-step tasks).
- Explicit finish tool + robust JSON extraction (tolerates prose around JSON).
- New cross-platform `search` tool (grep) in Workspace/executor.
- Fix: SessionStore.emit serializes non-string messages (task.graph snapshot
  was a list -> "type 'list' is not supported" crashed every real agent run).
- Fix: ProjectMemory.remember_result moved to the base class (orchestrator uses
  the base ProjectMemory; AttributeError crashed runs at completion).

Frontend:
- Conversational Agent view (default): task -> streamed steps (plan, per-role
  model, tool calls + results, review, step ✓) -> final summary with details.
  Live via WebSocket; approval gate surfaced inline.
- Tabs: Agent / Chat / Workspace / Models / Sessions. Arena tab removed.

Tests: tests/test_agent_loop.py (history/finish/parse/search),
tests/test_session_store.py (non-str event + remember_result). 78 passed / 0 failed.
Verified end-to-end via a headless (Playwright) run against a local Ollama-shaped
server: planner -> executor(search) -> reviewer(PASS) x2 -> completed.

